# The fork: tools/fork.sh rebuilds it from upstream and patches/
src/
# Build output: DLLs, the checkpoint binaries, backups, run logs
build/
# Raw recordings of every launch (~11 GB); data/ holds the tables built from them
captures/
# The bench's Wine prefix: a copy of the game's, with the player's profile in it
prefix/
# Decompilations and shader dumps of the game: its publisher's code
analysis/
# Sizes the features learned on this machine: every machine writes its own
learned/
# Ghidra's download and install, and its project of the game's executable (the game's code again)
tools/dl-ghidra/
tools/dl-ghidramcp/
tools/ghidra_12.1.4_PUBLIC/
tools/ghidra-proj/
# Logs, vkd3d's pipeline cache, Python bytecode
*.log
vkd3d-proton.cache
__pycache__/
